{"lesson":{"id":"completion_carre_sommet","title":"Compléter le carré de x² + 6x − 7 et lire le sommet","language":"fr","learning_goal":"Transformer x² + 6x − 7 en forme canonique a(x − h)² + k pour lire directement le sommet de la parabole."},"math_context":{"symbols":{},"expressions":{}}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_depart","introduces":[{"id":"trinome","type":"math","content":"x^2 + 6x - 7","parts":[{"id":"carre","text":"x^2"},{"id":"bande","text":"+ 6x"},{"id":"const","text":"- 7"}]},{"id":"axe","type":"line","params":{"from":[-4,-2],"to":[3,-2]}},{"id":"zero1","type":"point","params":{"at":[1,0]},"frame":"axe","style":{"role":"given"}},{"id":"zero2","type":"point","params":{"at":[-7,0]},"frame":"axe","style":{"role":"given"}}],"beats":[{"id":"pose","say":"Compléter le carré, c'est réécrire x au carré plus six x moins sept sous la forme a fois x moins h au carré, plus k.","cues":[{"id":"c_trinome","text":"x au carré plus six x moins sept"},{"id":"c_canonique","text":"x moins h au carré"}],"do":[{"id":"w_carre","verb":"write","target":"trinome","part":"carre","at":"cue:c_trinome"},{"id":"w_bande","verb":"write","target":"trinome","part":"bande","at":"after:w_carre"},{"id":"w_const","verb":"write","target":"trinome","part":"const","at":"after:w_bande"},{"id":"d_axe","verb":"draw","target":"axe","at":"cue:c_canonique"}]},{"id":"pourquoi","say":"Pourquoi cette forme ? Parce qu'elle donne le sommet tout de suite : h et k sont les coordonnées du sommet. Mais d'abord, voyons pourquoi on ajoute neuf.","cues":[{"id":"c_sommet","text":"les coordonnées du sommet"},{"id":"c_neuf","text":"on ajoute neuf"}],"do":[{"id":"h_canonique","verb":"highlight","target":"trinome","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_sommet","end":"cue_end:c_sommet"}],"pause_after":"normal"}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_ajout_neuf","introduces":[{"id":"aire","type":"polygon","params":{"vertices":[[0,0],[4,0],[4,4],[0,4]]}},{"id":"piece1","type":"polygon","params":{"vertices":[[0,0],[4,0],[4,4],[0,4]]}},{"id":"piece2","type":"polygon","params":{"vertices":[[4,0],[7,0],[7,4],[4,4]]}},{"id":"piece3","type":"polygon","params":{"vertices":[[4,4],[7,4],[7,7],[4,7]]}},{"id":"lbl1","type":"label","content":"x²","attachment":{"parent":"piece1","anchor":"center"}},{"id":"lbl2","type":"label","content":"3x","attachment":{"parent":"piece2","anchor":"center"}},{"id":"lbl3","type":"label","content":"3x","attachment":{"parent":"piece3","anchor":"center"}},{"id":"trou","type":"label","content":"9 manque","attachment":{"parent":"aire","anchor":"top"}},{"id":"lien","type":"math","content":"x^2 + 6x = (x + 3)^2 - 9","layout":{"next_to":"aire","direction":"right","gap":"lg"}}],"beats":[{"id":"demi","say":"Prends la moitié du coefficient de x, c'est trois. Un carré x par x, plus deux bandes de trois x : on a le x carré plus six x.","cues":[{"id":"c_moitie","text":"moitié du coefficient"},{"id":"c_trois","text":"c'est trois"},{"id":"c_deux_bandes","text":"deux bandes de trois x"}],"do":[{"id":"d_p1","verb":"draw","target":"piece1","at":"beat:start"},{"id":"s_l1","verb":"show","target":"lbl1","at":"after:d_p1"},{"id":"d_p2","verb":"draw","target":"piece2","start":"cue:c_deux_bandes","end":"cue_end:c_deux_bandes"},{"id":"s_l2","verb":"show","target":"lbl2","at":"after:d_p2"},{"id":"d_p3","verb":"draw","target":"piece3","at":"cue:c_trois"}]},{"id":"coin","say":"Il manque le coin : trois par trois, donc neuf. On ajoute neuf et on retire neuf pour ne rien changer.","cues":[{"id":"c_coin","text":"le coin"},{"id":"c_neuf","text":"donc neuf"},{"id":"c_retire","text":"on retire neuf"}],"do":[{"id":"s_l3","verb":"show","target":"lbl3","at":"cue:c_coin"},{"id":"s_trou","verb":"show","target":"trou","at":"cue:c_neuf"},{"id":"w_lien","verb":"write","target":"lien","at":"cue:c_retire"}],"pause_after":"normal"}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_canonique","introduces":[{"id":"etape1","type":"math","content":"x^2 + 6x - 7 = (x + 3)^2 - 9 - 7"},{"id":"etape2","type":"math","content":"= (x + 3)^2 - 16"},{"id":"sommet","type":"math","content":"S(-3 ; -16)","style":{"role":"result"}},{"id":"symetrie","type":"line","params":{"from":[-3,-20],"to":[-3,5]},"style":{"role":"accent"}},{"id":"ptS","type":"point","params":{"at":[-3,-16]},"frame":"symetrie","style":{"role":"result"}},{"id":"lblS","type":"label","content":"S(-3 ; -16)","attachment":{"parent":"ptS","anchor":"right"}}],"beats":[{"id":"remplace","say":"Reprenons l'expression de départ. On remplace x carré plus six x par x plus trois au carré moins neuf, et on garde le moins sept.","cues":[{"id":"c_remplace","text":"x plus trois au carré moins neuf"},{"id":"c_garde","text":"le moins sept"}],"do":[{"id":"f_area","verb":"fade_out","target":"aire","at":"cue:c_remplace"},{"id":"f_p1","verb":"fade_out","target":"piece1","at":"cue:c_remplace"},{"id":"f_p2","verb":"fade_out","target":"piece2","at":"cue:c_remplace"},{"id":"f_p3","verb":"fade_out","target":"piece3","at":"cue:c_remplace"},{"id":"f_l1","verb":"fade_out","target":"lbl1","at":"cue:c_remplace"},{"id":"f_l2","verb":"fade_out","target":"lbl2","at":"cue:c_remplace"},{"id":"f_l3","verb":"fade_out","target":"lbl3","at":"cue:c_remplace"},{"id":"f_trou","verb":"fade_out","target":"trou","at":"cue:c_remplace"},{"id":"f_lien","verb":"fade_out","target":"lien","at":"cue:c_remplace"},{"id":"f_trinome","verb":"fade_out","target":"trinome","at":"cue:c_remplace"},{"id":"w_e1","verb":"write","target":"etape1","at":"cue:c_remplace"}]},{"id":"simplifie","say":"Moins neuf moins sept, ça fait moins seize. Voilà la forme canonique : x plus trois au carré moins seize.","cues":[{"id":"c_seize","text":"moins seize"},{"id":"c_canonique","text":"forme canonique"}],"do":[{"id":"t_e","verb":"transform","source":"etape1","target":"etape2","at":"cue:c_seize"},{"id":"h_e2","verb":"highlight","target":"etape2","role":"result","at":"after:t_e"},{"id":"f_axe","verb":"fade_out","target":"axe","at":"cue:c_canonique"},{"id":"d_sym","verb":"draw","target":"symetrie","at":"cue:c_canonique"}]},{"id":"lire","say":"On lit directement le sommet : h vaut moins trois, k vaut moins seize. Le sommet est à moins trois, moins seize.","cues":[{"id":"c_lire","text":"h vaut moins trois"},{"id":"c_sommet","text":"Le sommet est"}],"do":[{"id":"s_ptS","verb":"show","target":"ptS","at":"cue:c_lire"},{"id":"s_lblS","verb":"show","target":"lblS","at":"cue:c_sommet"},{"id":"w_sommet","verb":"write","target":"sommet","at":"cue:c_sommet"}],"pause_after":"normal"}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_retenir","introduces":[{"id":"idee","type":"text","content":"Compléter le carré : ajoute et retire le carré de la moitié du coefficient de x, puis lis (h ; k).","layout":{"next_to":"etape2","direction":"down","gap":"md"}}],"beats":[{"id":"retenir","say":"À retenir : on ajoute et on retire le carré de la moitié du coefficient de x.","cues":[{"id":"c_retenir","text":"À retenir"},{"id":"c_moitie","text":"la moitié du coefficient"}],"do":[{"id":"cadre","verb":"camera.focus","targets":["etape2","sommet","idee"],"bounds":"layout_bounds","at":"cue:c_retenir"},{"id":"w_idee","verb":"write","target":"idee","at":"cue:c_moitie"}]},{"id":"phrase","say":"Avec x plus trois au carré moins seize, le sommet est à moins trois, moins seize. La forme canonique te donne les coordonnées du sommet sans calcul.","cues":[{"id":"c_canonique","text":"forme canonique"},{"id":"c_sommet","text":"le sommet est"}],"do":[{"id":"h_sommet","verb":"highlight","target":"sommet","role":"result","start":"cue:c_sommet","end":"cue_end:c_sommet"}],"pause_after":"long"}]}}
